Source: liquid/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/github/fletchmckee/liquid/internal/LiquidShader.kt

The rounded-rectangle signed distance field, analytical normals, spherical lens
profile, cubic RGB dispersion, saturation/contrast adjustment and edge lighting
are adapted in shaders/liquid_glass.frag. The Flutter adaptation adds shared
background capture and affine coordinate mapping. Optical normal-field radii
cover the refraction band to remove diagonal creases in small-corner bubbles;
the visible shape retains its configured radii. Source UVs account for the
bottom-up render-target textures used by Impeller GLES. Source samples stay clear.
Out-of-shape and transparent-pixel resampling branches were not carried over.
